title: date_borsalino_4_intro
location: quarters
---
<<declare $bod4_points = 0>>

It's been another full day of work and team-building chaos!
Finally, some time to decompress... maybe you'll freshen up and then train, or perhaps go to the city. That's what you're thinking, when your Den Den Mushi rings!
{$borsalino}: Hello~o? Hello~o...
{$borsalino}: This is Borsalino...
{$name}: Oh! Hi!
{$borsalino}: {$name}, I owe you a proper date, don't I? I know I have been... disappearing...
{$borsalino}: Very busy, you see...
{$borsalino}: So, if you don't have anything to do this evening... I was thinking that perhaps it would be a good opportunity to... ah... correct that mistake, wouldn't it~?
How do you react?
-> Confused
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$name}: A date?!
    {$name}: I must've forgotten.
    {$borsalino}: Forgotten, had you?
    He hums. Maybe he's disappointed... it's hard to tell.
    Well, he *has* been dragging his feet on this one for a very, very long time!
-> Flirty
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$name}: Why don't you come over right now and make up for it?
    Borsalino suddenly loses his usual drawl.
    {$borsalino}: {$name}, p-please....
    {$borsalino}: We're trying to keep things PG-rated in this game, aren't we?
    {$name}: (*Cute.*)
-> Demanding
    {$name}: You've been dragging your feet for so long on this one, huh?!
    Borsalino chuckles. You can practically hear the shrug.
    {$borsalino}: Well, well... I'm a busy man...
-> Playful
    {$name}: Oh, I don't know...
    {$name}: I actually had plans for tonight, you know...
    {$borsalino}: Oh, really...?
    {$name}: Nope!
    {$name}: Scared, were you?
    Borsalino chuckles.
{$borsalino}: Oka~ay... I'll take that as a yes.
{$borsalino}: I'll pick you up in an hour...
-Click!-
It seems that you have a proper date with him.
You have a [wave]proper date[/wave] !!!
Is it time to panic?
-> PANIC!!!
    You fling yourself away from the desk and thrash around your room.
    The Den Den Mushi stares from his shell.
-> No, things will work out!
    He likes you. It's not too obvious with the way he is, but...
    Chin up! Things can work!
Now, to find something to wear...
<<jump date_borsalino_4_gettingready>>
===

title: date_borsalino_4_gettingready
location: quarters
---

// {Depending on the amount of positives you get in the next questions, Borsalino will have one of three reactions.} //HOW DO??
You stare into your closet. Are you going to be dressing up?
-> You'd rather do casual and comfy, don't think this date will be anything fancy. (-)
    Oh, of course! The bakery trip on a lazy Sunday look...what's not to love about joggers anyway?
-> Not TOO much... Don't want to look too interested.
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    Business casual it is! Maybe he'll appreciate the intentional lack of effort!
-> Yes, you'll wear something that you really shine in!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    Bring on that glamour! Borsalino loves to dazzle, after all...
How about accessories?
-> Nothing exaggerated, but all planned to match!
    Sounds good! At the end of the day, you've won him over by being yourself.
-> Sure, really glamorous and SHINY! Bring it on!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    You're pretty sure the Admiral has found his match in you. You'll make a great couple. Blinding, almost.
-> No, that's not really my thing, I'll just throw my work boots on and call it a day.
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    ...Well, that's a decision!
Hair gel, makeup, cologne, perfume?
-> Just a touch, be seductive. Nothing wrong with spicing things up.
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    Very good! Bring on the glamour!
-> I'll just BATHE in the best perfume I can find.
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    You proceed to cough at yourself... well, you certainly have an *aura* now!
-> I think I look the best when I'm being myself, so I won't do more or less than I usually do.
    That's a very good point!
Looking good!
-> Yes!
-> Still panicking!
-> Scratch all this, I'll just get a pinstriped suit and aviators!
    <<set $bod4_points +=2>>
There's a knock at the door...
Well, that was fast! You were half-expecting him to be an hour late, as usual.
But of course, he can teleport.
{$borsalino}: Hello, dear {$name}...
// {If 0, 1 positives in the previous interaction} //HOW DO??
{$borsalino}: Oh, dear, did I forget to tell you we were going for dinner together...? My~y bad...
You feel your face burning. So this WAS a fancy date!
This airheaded old man.
Oh, well.
// {If 2 positives in the previous interaction} //HOW DO??
{$borsalino}: Hello~o, dear {$name}.
{$borsalino}: You look very nice...
{$borsalino}: ...Let's go, shall we...?
// {If 3, 4 positives in the previous interaction} //HOW DO??
{$borsalino}: Ah! {$name}! You look radiant. It's good that I have my sunglasses on.
{$borsalino}: Let's go, my dear~...
You cling to his arm as he guides you downstairs, quite proud of his date.
He will definitely boast about this at any chance he gets.
<<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_date_intro>>
===

title: date_borsalino_4_dinner_date_intro
location: town
---

The breeze catches on your hair, sending shivers under the fabric of your clothes. It's still an early evening. The orange sky will soon turn indigo, but now, the waves are still pink with some lingering blue under the sunset. There's a playful splash of water - you see schools of porpoises swimming in the distance.
You're amazed at the sight. And, anchored at the port, its impressive silhouette cut against the evening, you see a ship fit for a royal! It takes a few moments to click – this must be one of those impressive vessels you saw over at the G-9 base.
{$borsalino}: Well, well... I hope you like this.
{$borsalino}: I remember how these ships caught your attention back at the base... Vice Admiral Woof was kind enough to lend us one.
-> I actually don't like that royals gift them these ships at all!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$name}: All of this dirty money... couldn't we have gone for something a bit more humble?
    Borsalino almost pouts.
    {$borsalino}: Hmm...
    {$borsalino}: Well, I'm not going to lie, I hoped you would indulge me this once.
    {$borsalino}: Ah, it doesn't matter.
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_date_onboard>>
-> Well, even I have to admit it...this is impressive!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$name}: And very beautiful! Look at the woodwork!
    {$borsalino}: Yes... true... I do suppose that the people at the G-9 deserve it.
-> This is exactly what I wanted!
    {$borsalino}: It's very impressive.
    {$borsalino}: Shipbuilding is an art all by itself, wouldn't you agree...?
Borsalino walks you along the side of the ship, its sides sculpted like vines, the figurehead a siren looking onwards.
-> Admire the ship.
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$name}: It's very unique work!
    {$borsalino}: Mm-hm...
    {$borsalino}: I like it, when you can tell that shipbuilders are allowed to be freely creative... the result is always the most beautiful...
    He smiles and winks at you.
-> Say nothing.
    {$borsalino}: Hmm~... you're not thinking about work, are you?
    -> Yes, I am.
        <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
        {$borsalino}: Ah, {$name}... always so hard-working...
        {$borsalino}: But, to be honest, I'd rather leave work at Headquarters if you don't mind...
    -> Of course not!
        {$borsalino}: That's the spirit...
{$borsalino}: Ah~. Are you hungry? I hope so.
{$borsalino}: Let's get on board...
<<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_date_onboard>>
===

title: date_borsalino_4_dinner_date_onboard
location: ship deck
---

You approach the side of the ship, hull standing tall even in comparison to Borsalino.
Then, Borsalino leans in toward you, and... *zap!* The world disappears in a whirl around you!
You reappear, in a burst of sparkles, on the creaking ship deck.
There's a tent there, very tastefully decorated, candlelight painting soft shadows along the deck.
-> Wow! I'm dizzy!
    {$borsalino}: Oh, I'm sorry...
    {$borsalino}: I just prefer to move like this all the time...
    {$borsalino}: Saves some trouble, doesn't *i~it*?
-> That was cool!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$name}: You have the best powers.
    Borsalino smiles knowingly.
    {$borsalino}: It's exciting, isn't it...?
-> How can you stand to move like that all the time?!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$name}: I'd much rather walk anywhere.
    {$borsalino}: Aww, but where's the fun in that...?
You follow him down elaborate staircases to a tastefully decorated dining room. Paper lamps hang from the walls like colorful fireflies, making for a cozy, playful atmosphere. Candles illuminate a table for two, casting reflections on the wine glasses.
You sit down. He still looks as unfazed as ever, always with that half-smile, but the candlelight does make him seem a bit gentler. //HOW DO?? Location change to bar
In a flash, he produces a bottle of wine and serves you first.
{$borsalino}: South Blue dry~... one of my favorites.
{$borsalino}: And, thanks to my dear friends in the New Marineford kitchen, I had your favorite meal prepared, you see...?
{$name}: My favorite meal!
The food on the plate looks and smells delicious.
{$borsalino}: Oh, don't bother thanking me... I know you'd do the same for me...
You do remember what Borsalino's favorite food is, right?
-> It's miso ramen!
    {$borsalino}: That's correct... in part.
    {$borsalino}: What can I say, I'm an indecisive man...
-> It's bananas!
    {$borsalino}: That's correct... in part.
    {$borsalino}: What can I say, there is too much good food in the world...
-> It's sherry wine!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Hmm... not really... you must be thinking of someone else...
    Whoops... did you just get his favorite food mixed up with his colleague's?
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_bad_route>>
-> It's rice with yellow peppers!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Hmm... not really... you must be thinking of someone else...
    Whoops... did you just get his favorite food mixed up with his colleague's?
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_bad_route>>
-> This is a trick question! You have multiple favourite foods!
    <<set $bod4_points +=2>>
    {$borsalino}: Ahh, {$name}...
    {$borsalino}: You know me too well...
    He grins indulgently.
{$borsalino}: Still... I will really have to congratulate the chef...
{$borsalino}: Although, they were happy to cook something other than your typical, ah, mess hall food, you see...?
-> Well, that's their job!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    He looks at you quizzically.
    {$borsalino}: Maybe it is... but everyone appreciates a challenge...
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_bad_route>>
-> I believe you! This is amazing!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$borsalino}: They wouldn't do this for just anybody, you know...
    {$name}: I remember your advice.
        -> Always make friends in important places!
            <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
            {$borsalino}: Hmm... I knew you were a good listener...
        -> Today for you, tomorrow for me!
            {$borsalino}: So to speak...
        -> Be the perfect mix of scary and friendly so people don't dare say no!
            <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
            {$borsalino}: Aww, {$name}... is that really how you see me?
            {$name}: I meant it as a compliment...
            <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_bad_route>>
Inevitably, the conversation while you eat delves into work.
{$borsalino}: You have been with us for quite some time now...
{$borsalino}: So, what do you think...? I hope it was the right choice, working for us Admirals...
{$name}: I think...
-> I like the job, but I'm always insecure about doing the right thing!
    {$borsalino}: Ah, well... with some more experience, I suppose...
    {$borsalino}: We were all new at some point, {$name}, and look at us now.
-> It's not always easy, but I appreciate a challenge!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$borsalino}: You know... I have seen everything. Many good things, bad things.
    {$borsalino}: *Done*... some bad things, even.
    {$borsalino}: Ah, it doesn't matter...
    {$borsalino}: But then, I see young officers fight for what they think is right... despite it all, I can't help feeling inspired.
    He smiles, a Cheshire cat's grin under the lamplight.
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_good_route>>
-> I mean, we haven't worked a day since I came aboard, am I right?
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    Borsalino chuckles.
    {$borsalino}: It depends on what you mean by ‘work', I *suppo~ose*...
    {$name}: Well, so what do you understand by “work”?
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_good_route>>
-> Nah, I should've really chosen to work with less difficult folks.
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Ah, at least you're honest...
    {$borsalino}: Although... “less difficult folks”... you mean here, in the Navy...?
    He looks skeptical...
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_bad_route>>
{$borsalino}: Well, let me put it this way...
{$borsalino}: Over the past years... Things have gotten *qui~ite* tense here, you see...?
{$borsalino}: Even before Issho was promoted...
-> Why, because Sakazuki and Kuzan can't stop being dumb?
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Ah... being dumb is a way to put it...
    {$borsalino}: But it's a little more than arguing, I would say...
-> It must have been hard on you to be stuck in the middle.
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$borsalino}: *Ha~ard...?*
    {$borsalino}: Well... Punk Hazard was very worrying, but not only for me...
    {$borsalino}: Oh, well... does it matter...?
-> Well, it seems like it's alright now!
    Borsalino stays in silence, smiling quietly.
{$borsalino}: You see... my point is...
{$borsalino}: I wouldn't have bet on seeing them... you know... tolerating each other's presence in the same room again...
{$borsalino}: I thought those times were over, *yo~ou* see...
{$borsalino}: And to get a taste of the old times... even if it's just that, a taste...
He smiles, the way the corners of his eyes wrinkle makes it seem genuine.
-> Tell me a story about you three in the old days!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    Borsalino's face lights up.
    {$borsalino}: Oh dear...
    {$borsalino}: Well, all those things about us in the two-truths-one-lie game were true...
    {$borsalino}: You can imagine... Kuzan and Sakazuki, always at each other's thro~oat... and I...
    {$name}: You were always probably
        -> ...fueling the fire.
            <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
            {$borsalino}: I mean... *So~ometimes,* it was funny...
        -> ...balancing things out.
            {$borsalino}: I suppose you could say so...
    {$borsalino}: *Ri~ight, ri~ight,* you got me...
    {$borsalino}: But one thing you need to know about Sakazuki is that he has an almost *unhealthy* respect for his elders... he used to run behind Garp, Sengoku and Tsuru like an eager little lapdog...
    {$borsalino}: So sometimes, when he'd start berating Kuzan... he got qui~ite vicious, you see. You know, a tough man like him... he has a way with words, *do~oesn't* he...?
    {$borsalino}: I'd just do anything to get Lady Tsuru's attention and have her hear whatever obscenities he was saying...
    {$borsalino}: And just wait... until he realised she was standing right behind him...
    {$borsalino}: You should have seen his face...
    {$borsalino}: Kuzan and I... we used to have a few good laughs together...
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_dinner_good_route>>
-> If I've done such a good job, you think it will last?
    Borsalino pauses, the candlelight flickering on his aviators.
    {$borsalino}: Well, my dear {$name}, does anything last?
    {$borsalino}: I don't think you should be too concerned about that...
-> Well, so things are looking up, everything's okay now isn't it?
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: We are still in quite an uncertain time, although...
    {$borsalino}: Ah... there are surely better things to talk about during a date, aren't there...?
{$borsalino}: The thing is that they haven't been quite themselves after...
{$borsalino}: ... Well... not Punk Hazard, quite... it has been like this for a long time.
{$borsalino}: Ah, look at us, just talking about work and colleagues...
{$borsalino}: Did you enjoy the food...?
<<jump date_borsalino_4_neutral_end>>
===

title: date_borsalino_4_dinner_bad_route
location: bar
---

Well, that wasn't too sleek of you. But you'll make up for it!
You reach out for the wine just as he's going to do the same and – oh my, your hands touch!
-> Freak out!
    You flinch! Not that you don't want you both to be touching! But, but, but—
    It's exciting enough for you to accidentally knock the wine over!
-> Play it cool.
    {$name}: Oh.
    {$borsalino}: So~o, do you want to serve the wine?
    {$name}: No big deal, really.
    {$borsalino}: So shall you...? Or shall I...?
    You have an awkward shuffle-like moment and...
    End up knocking the wine bottle over and spilling it!
Uh oh. The food is ruined.
And so... is Borsalino's suit.
{$borsalino}: ......
You watch his grin tighten into a grimace.
-> Try to wipe it off.
    You lean towards him, and he lifts his hands up.
    {$borsalino}: Ah, {$name}, you really don't have to...
    {$borsalino}: It's... just a stain...
-> Hey, the date just got better, didn't it?
    He's not in the mood for jokes...
-> Can't you just like... Evaporate it or something...?
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Oh... suddenly, you know everything about Logia powers, don't *yo~ou,* dear...?
He runs a hand down the lapels of his dress. A burst of light! You wince at its blinding, aggressive brightness.
{$borsalino}: Ah... it's just not the same...
You have no idea what he means.
{$borsalino}: ...
{$borsalino}: Don't worry about it...
{$borsalino}: But ah, we will need something else to eat, won't we...?
-> Of course!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$borsalino}: O~okay then...
-> I'll fix this!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Mmm... I don't think that's a good idea.
    {$name}: (Ouch... That hurt!)
    {$borsalino}: All I mean is that... well, you have a long day of work behind yourself, {$name}...
{$borsalino}: Let me make a call...
While he leaves the room, you collect the bottle and try to wipe the cutlery clean...
You could use some of this wine after all...
And then...
You knock the candlestick over!
And it's burning a nice black stain into the tablecloth!
{$name}: ...
-> Try to smother it.
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    You throw your napkin at the flame, but somehow it only starts smoldering.
    {$name}: Oh no. I should've paid more attention during the first aid courses.
    It seems that your only other choice is to pour something onto it...
    Uhh...why not the wine!
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_route_bad_fire>>
-> Pour wine on it.
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_route_bad_fire>>
===

title: date_borsalino_4_route_bad_fire
location: bar
---

The wine must be pretty strong...
Because it just caught fire and is burning the entire table.
{$name}: Gah! Help!!
Borsalino appears in a cloud of sparkles.
{$borsalino}: Hmmm...
{$borsalino}: Hmmm...
{$borsalino}: ...
{$borsalino}: This is not good...
{$name}: You don't say!
{$borsalino}: I didn't think I was going on a date with Sengoku's child...
-> (Okay, that was cute.)
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    The Rosinante slander has made its way into your heart.
    He smiles at you. He's got this!
-> (Isn't he going to do something about this?!)
    He's certainly taking his time....
-> (Continue trying to put it out!)
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    Well, *somebody* has to do it, right?!
Borsalino disappears again, a flash across the heat.
In a cloud of sparkles, he reappears and tosses a bucket of seawater on the fire.
You... happen to be in the way.
{$borsalino}: A~ah... I'm sorry, {$name}... you were in the way...
-> I deserved it.
    {$borsalino}: Oh, no, no... Don't worry about this...
    {$borsalino}: Accidents happen, don't they?
    {$borsalino}: I have them all the time on duty...
-> What the hell are you doing?!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Oh, I'm *so~orry*...
    ...
    He does not seem sorry.
As you watch, the fire grows bigger, and it's starting to scorch the insides of the ship!
Oh, all these fancy wooden carvings...
[Fade to black] //HOW DO??
One emergency intervention later...
{$borsalino}: Ah... working hazards, my dear...
-> I'm so sorry!
    {$borsalino}: Ah, you don't have to apologize...
-> We were already off to such a bad start...
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Hmmm...
    {$borsalino}: It didn't go how you had pictured either, did it...?
{$borsalino}: What's the worst that can happen, though...?
{$borsalino}: I do suppose... That it will take some time for the G-9 to lend me any other ships...
{$borsalino}: And of course, this could affect my network of contacts...
{$borsalino}: Oh, and the original owners are the World Nobles, aren't they? Wouldn't it be funny if we got in trouble with them because of this...
-> That's not very reassuring.
    {$borsalino}: Oh... You think so?
-> Anybody can have a bad day, right?
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$name}: I promise you it won't be like this all the time.
    {$borsalino}: Ah... okay, {$name}.
    {$borsalino}: Let's do something else if we manage to... ah, meet up another time.
-> Let's do this again, some other time!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Oh, I only have so many bridges I can burn...
    Seems like it wasn't quite the time to say that...
{$borsalino}: ...
{$borsalino}: Oh well... I will see you another time.
{$borsalino}: Goodbye, {$name}.
{$name}: ....
Ugh, you feel embarrassment setting your face aflame. What a bad night!
===

title: date_borsalino_4_dinner_good_route
location: bar
---

{$name}: What I mean is...
{$name}: Well, what I really have been meaning to ask is...
{$borsalino}: Hmmm?
You pause, trying to gather your thoughts.
-> So when are we going to make things official?
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$name}: I mean, we have been seeing each other for a while, and...
    Borsalino doesn't flinch, but... you could swear he is a little bit pale.
    {$borsalino}: Make things official... You mean...?
    {$borsalino}: What I think you mean...?
    {$borsalino}: Ah... {$name}...
    He removes his sunglasses and scratches his temple.
    {$borsalino}: *We~ell,* I think compromise is quite a slippery slope...
    -> Get angry.
        <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
        {$name}: No shit! You've been avoiding this for ages!
        {$name}: Just getting one date with you is so complicated.
        {$name}: You need to make up for it, or at least make a decision!
        {$borsalino}: ...Oh... I'm sorry you feel like this, {$name}...
        -> That's not an apology!!
            <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
            {$borsalino}: Hmmm~
