            Before you can protest, he disappears and doesn't return.
            <<jump date_borsalino_4_Date_Ends>>
        -> No, I knew it was going to be complicated.
            {$name}: I mean, not only because of your rank, but you being you, after all.
            {$borsalino}: Uh... I know what you mean, I *suppo~ose*...
