            {$name}: Oh, hum, I mean.
            {$name}: Or not.
            {$name}: Let's get dessert!
            {$borsalino}: Oh... of course.
            Perhaps he needs a bit more time to mull over this...
            He doesn't seem perturbed at all, pretending nothing happened.
            <<jump date_borsalino_4_neutral_end>>
-> Let's get dessert!
    Oof! A tense moment averted.
    {$borsalino}: Mmm? Oh, of course... of course.
    This would have been a good moment to ask him something a bit more personal, but... perhaps there will be more chances.
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_neutral_end>>
-> I want to get to know you better!
    <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Hmmm?
    {$name}: All I mean is that...
    {$name}: Even if we know each other as friends, and at work... I have the feeling that you're putting up a facade.
    {$borsalino}: ...
    You have no idea what this silence means.
    -> Uh... is he OK with this?
        <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
        {$name}: I didn't mean to say anything wrong.
        {$name}: We can talk about something else, if you want.
        {$borsalino}: Oh no, no no...
        {$borsalino}: I'm curious about what you have to say.
    -> Continue! We dig the hole deeper!
        <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
        {$name}: Ah... Screw it.
        {$name}: I mean that all of *you* Admirals are incredibly closed off, you know that?
        {$borsalino}: Hmm...
    {$name}: I want to know the real person behind all the smoke and mirrors!
    Borsalino takes quite a few seconds to answer.
    The candle glows, dances in the dark.
    {$borsalino}: Would you like to stretch your legs, {$name}...?
    {$borsalino}: Why don't we have a walk under the stars...?
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_good_route_cont>>
===

title: date_borsalino_4_good_route_cont
location: ship deck
---

You follow Borsalino outside, where the ship creaks under the both of you.
The velvet black sky stretches far and wide, dotted with dizzying constellations. The breeze sends a chill down your spine.
{$borsalino}: Oh... are you cold?
Borsalino removes his coat and puts it over your shoulders. It's as big as a blanket, and warm with his body heat.
Nice!
{$borsalino}: Well, well...
{$borsalino}: I... am sorry to have been avoiding these kinds of moments, {$name}-
{$borsalino}: But sometimes, it is easier to focus on the day-to-day and not pay serious things much mind... isn't it...?
{$borsalino}: It has been a very nice evening, though...
{$name}: Ah... can I ask you...
-> ...about your family?
    {$borsalino}: My family, you say?
    {$borsalino}: We~ell, you know Sakazuki and Kuzan already, don't you...?
    -> Colleagues are not real family!
        <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
        {$borsalino}: Oh... do you really think so, even after all this time here?
        {$borsalino}: Hmm...
        <<jump date_borsalino_4_good_route_end>>
    -> Do you have anyone else?
        <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
        {$borsalino}: Anyone as close as they are?
        {$borsalino}: Hmm...
        {$borsalino}: Yes... I do.
        {$borsalino}: But I might have to disappoint you, {$name}, since he is still a work colleague... *sort of*...
        {$name}: Are we talking about Sentomaru?
            {$borsalino}: Yes, and my mentor, Dr. Vegapunk... I look up to him.
            {$borsalino}: Ever since we started working together on different projects, I do enjoy spending time over at Egghead Island...
            {$borsalino}: Lately, with that man Kuma, and his little daughter Bonney. For sure, it's a part of my job, but...
            {$borsalino}: Hmm... not strictly professional. It's...
            {$borsalino}: ...
            {$borsalino}: Just nice.
            (loop back to questions) //HOW DO??
-> ...about your dreams?
    Borsalino chuckles. It almost makes you wonder if you've said something silly.
    {$borsalino}: Oh, don't look at me like that... I just didn't think you were the type to ask me this...
    {$borsalino}: *We~ell*... I have to say...
    {$borsalino}: I'm not quite... as clear-cut as Sakazuki, or Kuzan, or Issho, with their ideals...
    {$borsalino}: On the field... I always preferred having some, ah, wiggle room for action, you know...? There are many situations... in which this has come in handy...
    The wrinkles around his eyes soften, his gaze fixed on the stars.
    {$borsalino}: Perhaps... I may have been more like them at some point, when I was younger... but now?
    {$borsalino}: Ah, the most important thing to me was learning... even though, the more we learn, the more...
    {$borsalino}: Ah...
    {$borsalino}: *Disenchanted* we grow...
    -> How sad!
        <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
        {$borsalino}: Oh, I suppose...
        {$borsalino}: But now, now... you don't think we live in a pitch-perfect world, do *you...?*
        <<jump date_borsalino_4_good_route_end>>
    -> That makes sense...
        <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
        {$name}: Maybe not the way I think, but...
        {$borsalino}: Ah, but you have just started your career... still young, so to speak...
        {$borsalino}: You see... sometimes, I see our cadets being headstrong, fighting for what is right... and I feel that spark again.
        {$borsalino}: Even some admiration...
        {$borsalino}: But, what can I say... this is not my fight anymore, is it...?
        (loop back to questions) //HOW DO??
-> ... about your past>
    {$borsalino}: About my past...?
    {$borsalino}: Well... there is not much to talk about, truly...
    {$borsalino}: I haven't been back to the North Blue in a *lo~ong* time... I suppose you can understand why...
    -> Come on! Reveal your Tragic Past to me!
        <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
        {$borsalino}: Mmm... if that's what you're looking for, I might have to disappoint you...
        {$borsalino}: I wasn't an unlucky man, in comparison to others...
        He smiles cryptically. It seems like this is the last thing he'll say about it!
        <<jump date_borsalino_4_good_route_end>>
    -> We don't have to talk about it.
        <<set $bod4_points +=1>>
        {$borsalino}: Oh... why not?
        {$borsalino}: I was orphaned, you see... as were many back in the North Blue at the time...
        {$borsalino}: It wasn't nice... but, well, that stopped mattering, didn't it...?
        {$borsalino}: The special thing about that place that I grew up in... were the books... this immense, old library... of course, it was prohibited to read them, but the caretakers didn't care, you know...
        {$borsalino}: I have always found... that being *flexible* with the rules gives the best results, doesn't it...?
        {$borsalino}: And then, of *co~ourse,* I ate this fruit.
        He raises an index finger, a beam collecting at the tip.
        Its star shape is hypnotizing.
        {$borsalino}: Which meant that, when the World Government inevitably shut that place down... they still had a use for me.
        {$borsalino}: That's how I became Dr. Vegapunk's disciple, did you know...? But ah, at last, working in the labs turned out to be too *bo~oring* for me...
        {$borsalino}: Hence, the Navy...
{$borsalino}: ...
{$borsalino}: I hope...
{$borsalino}: Are you in a rush to go back to Headquarters, {$name}...?
-> I think I could stay here.
    {$borsalino}: I see...
    {$borsalino}: Here, let me make a call.
    Borsalino produces his Den Den Mushi from a pocket and connects to...
    ...
    Sentomaru: What?!
    {$borsalino}: *Hello~o,* my dear nephew...
    Sentomaru: Huh? What do you want at this time of the night, old man?!
    {$borsalino}: ... I'm not that old...
    {$borsalino}: Awww, did I wake you up...?
    Sentomaru: Are you kiddin'? There's always stuff to do around here on Egghead. No rest for the wicked!
    {$borsalino}: Oh, I see...
    {$borsalino}: Say, Sentomaru... would it be okay if I came over with, ah, a friend...?
    {$borsalino}: I think you'd like to meet...
    It seems like the evening has just started.
    This went much better than you expected!
    <<jump date_borsalino_4_good_route_end_2>>
-> No, I'm quite tired.
    {$borsalino}: Ah, we will be docking soon...
    {$borsalino}: Thank you for the evening, dear {$name}.
    {$borsalino}: Ah, it is New Year's Eve soon, isn't it...?
    {$borsalino}: And your first here at Headquarters, right...?
    {$borsalino}: We always hold quite the impressive ball. Maybe that's an idea for, ah...
    He winks at you.
    {$borsalino}: The next time...
===

title: date_borsalino_4_neutral_end
location: ship deck
---

As a dessert, you get banana ice cream. Not bad!
You feel full from the good food and the wine, and Borsalino looks satisfied enough.
Although the conversation was nice, you get an unresolved feeling.
{$name}: The food was nice, but...
{$borsalino}: Hmm?
-> Say something lighthearted.
    {$name}: But I could eat a whole ton more!
    Borsalino blinks and pauses for a moment.
    {$name}: What? Did I say anything wrong?
    {$borsalino}: No, no...
    {$borsalino}: You just reminded me of... someone.
    You expect him to say more, but he smiles without a word.
-> Try to talk about something deeper.
    {$name}: We only really spoke about work.
    {$name}: I guess I was expecting to get to know you better.
    {$borsalino}: Oh, there's nothing to know...
    {$borsalino}: I'm a boring old man.
    Borsalino chuckles, entertained.
-> Ask him on another date soon.
    {$name}: I had fun, let's do this again!
    {$borsalino}: Mmm... sure, sure...
    {$borsalino}: Next time, you pick the place...
-> Nevermind.
    Borsalino looks at you from the corner of his eyes... but says nothing.
{$borsalino}: Shall we get some fresh air, {$name}?
The both of you go upstairs, to the deck. The sky is inky black, full of stars; a spill of dots into infinity.
{$borsalino}: Look, we'll be docking soon.
-> That was all?!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Aww... yes, you're welcome, too.
    The sarcastic response doesn't match his tone.
-> Well, thank you for the evening!
    {$borsalino}: My pleasure...
    {$borsalino}: Ah, it's New Year's Eve soon, isn't it...
    {$borsalino}: And your first here at Headquarters, right...?
    {$borsalino}: We always hold quite the impressive ball. Maybe that's an idea for, ah...
    He winks at you.
    {$borsalino}: The next time...
Hmm... you've known him for some months, and yet, he stays unreadable...
It's probably just a Borsalino thing.
===

title: date_borsalino_4_good_route_end
location: ship deck
---

{$borsalino}: Well, enough talk for today...
{$borsalino}: Look, we will be docking soon...
-> That was it?!
    <<set $bod4_points -=1>>
    {$borsalino}: Aww... yes, you're welcome, too.
    The sarcastic response doesn't match his tone.
-> Well, thank you for the evening!
    {$borsalino}: My pleasure...
{$borsalino}: Ah, it's New Year's Eve soon, isn't it...
{$borsalino}: And your first here at Headquarters, right...?
{$borsalino}: We always hold quite the impressive ball. Maybe that's an idea for, ah...
He winks at you.
{$borsalino}: The next time...
===

title: date_borsalino_4_good_route_end_2
location: quarters
---

When you finally make it home late that night, you're practically floating! Finally, you've made your way into this very hermetic man's heart.
===

title: date_borsalino_4_Date_Ends
location: quarters
---

You go home alone and think that didn't go too well. Oof.
===
